22. Target-Relative Rank Condition

For a scalar target, a necessary local condition is that

[
dT
]

not remain in an unobservable direction after the diagnostic perturbation.

A candidate rank condition is

[
\boxed{
\operatorname{rank}
\begin{bmatrix}
D_X(L_F^0h)D_UFv^\star\
D_X(L_F^1h)D_UFv^\star\
